2. Full Odorant Catalog

Use only exact names from this catalog. Each entry includes category (descriptor family), note (sensory character), volatility, location, pairs_well_with (other catalog odorants that blend well with this one), and avoid_with (other catalog odorants generally not combined with this one, each with a short reason).

